==================================================

THIS IS THE HIGHEST PRIORITY.

The current website is primarily a client-rendered React SPA.

The Express production fallback currently serves the same dist/index.html shell for application routes.

React changes document titles after client-side navigation, but route-specific metadata and complete initial HTML content are not consistently generated for public pages.

