Implement a reliable SSR, static pre-rendering or equivalent route-aware rendering solution for important public pages.

Required:

- Homepage.
- Menu page.
- Cake catalogue.
- Custom cake page.
- Individual published product pages.
- Published category pages.
- About.
- Gallery.
- Contact.
